  "promptSpec": {
    "id": "mosquito",
    "generator": "OpenAI imagegen built-in",
    "prompt": "Use case stylized-concept. Create an original high fidelity reference-informed fan-made pixel art animation sprite sheet of MOSQUITO, the former MSF commander from Metal Gear Solid V The Phantom Pain MAIN Mission22 Retake the Platform, 1984. His invading-force model wears a charcoal two-eye balaclava and black communications headset, worn olive drab long-sleeved combat fatigues and cargo trousers, dirty tan/olive plate vest with magazine pouches, brown belt, gloves and dark combat boots, black AM-MRS-4 style assault rifle. No modern bulky helmet, no eyepatch, no sunglasses, no futuristic armor. Match an old MSF soldier's practical lightly armored silhouette. Body faithful to in-game invasion uniform, mask conceals face; realistic adult male proportions. Crisp detailed pixel-art clusters for a serious 2D side-scrolling game. EXACTLY4columns by4rows of16 genuinely authored poses, all facingRIGHT orthographic side view, same body scale and foot baseline. Flat pure#FF00FF magenta background, thin purecyan grid boundaries including outerborder. All bodies AND guns inside central60% of each square cell, wide20% empty side margins and padding above head/below feet. Row1 idle four distinct breathing and head-watch phases with lowered rifle. Row2 move four alternating walking gait phases, not translated duplicates. Row3 interact four radio-call phases, lift left hand toward headset while right keeps rifle low, hold, listen, lower. Row4 react four non-graphic tactical brace/flinch/recover phases with rifle lowered. NO attack row, NO bullet, no blood, no gore, no scene or floor shadows, no text/logos/watermark/UI, no clipped limbs or rifle. Reference uniform: https://metalgear.fandom.com/wiki/Mosquito_Stinger_Force ; identity Mission22 and unmasked staff portrait visually checked at https://automaton-media.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/20180302-63858-002.jpg . This is the masked field model, not GroundZeroes Mosquite.",
    "generatedFile": "exec-524882ce-07c2-493b-af31-dc7c2f626e7a.png",
    "referenceUrls": [
      "https://metalgear.fandom.com/wiki/Mosquito",
      "https://metalgear.fandom.com/wiki/Mosquito_Stinger_Force",
      "https://automaton-media.com/articles/newsjp/20180302-63858/",
      "https://automaton-media.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/20180302-63858-002.jpg"
    ],
    "review": "Unmasked staff screenshot visually inspected in browser; masked invading-force uniform cross-checked with reference description. Original fan-made adaptation, no literal 1:1 claim. Distinct from Ground Zeroes Mosquite.",
    "limitations": [
      "Portrait approximates the in-game staff facial model from a low-resolution screenshot; field model is masked.",
      "Archive presentation does not implement Mission22 or a new hostile AI."
    ]
  },
